Changes: added derivations of slice thickness/offset and of the −½ rewinder rule (small-tip phase), Bloch simulations of slice profiles, rewinder sweep, chemical-shift displacement, thin-slice trade-offs and cross-talk, with realistic numbers and engineering notes; clarified that the rewinder area is ≈ −½ (exactly ½ only in the small-tip limit for symmetric pulses).*
